  "finding": "The v1 grant correctly fails closed because the canonical Builder ref moved from 93a9c46 to the foreign r4 receipt 01ee3ec. Preserve the full old and foreign ancestry under a new immutable archive, atomically retire only the exact 01ee3ec source, and quarantine PR 139 and both r4 Builder receipts from node-PR or duplicate-receipt resolution.",
  "acceptance_conditions": [
    "Every old and foreign commit, tree, ordered parent, payload digest, path, ref, PR, release, and authority binding is exact.",
    "The v1 authority and PR 139 can never authorize, identify, or resolve the successor Builder node.",
    "The new archive is absent before execution and equals exact 01ee3ec after one atomic source-head/archive-absence CAS transaction.",
    "The archive preserves 1268050 to 93a9c46 and 359a5c5 to 64ca3f to e34824d to 01ee3ec ancestry and the exact candidate tree.",
    "Fresh authenticated snapshot, reconciliation, full doctor, current release, status, and explicit Builder START NOW are required before a new canonical claim.",
    "Release, r4, PR 139, receipt-set, archive, source, lease, repository, origin, path, tree, case, or reuse drift fails closed."
  ],
  "dissent": [
    "The two r4 Builder receipts are adverse provenance only; neither is accepted as a current singleton-release completion receipt."
  ]
}
